# The suites of tools/suite.list in groups of similar length: one CI job per group (.github/workflows/ci.yml, matrix
# gruppo) and one Linux clone per group in the parallel run (tools/suite-parallelo.sh). Line: <group> <entry>, the
# entry spelled as in tools/suite.list. `tools/suite.sh --gruppo <k>/<n>` refuses (exit 2) a file whose groups are not
# 1..n, an entry of suite.list in no group or in two, an entry here that is not in suite.list.
# Inside a group the suites run in the order of suite.list. Balanced on the Linux times (seconds, clone in WSL) of the
# 1.5.0 full run, rollback 218 s and driver 382 s measured for 1.5.1: group 1 ≈ 816 s, group 2 ≈ 818 s, group 3 ≈ 804 s.
# tools/esempi-equiv.test.sh (the strict check of the certificate, MAAT_CERT_RICHIESTO) is in group 3.
# A suite red only in the parallel run goes in a group of its own (docs/TESTING-harness.md, «The parallel run»).

# group 1: the driver and the phases
1 driver
1 run-phase
1 finalize
1 guard

# group 2: the oracle, the rollback, the resume table
2 tools/oracolo.test.sh
2 rollback
2 cycle-state
2 messages
2 phase-events

# group 3: the public examples (certificate), the WSL tools, all the short ones
3 tools/esempi-equiv.test.sh
3 counterproof
3 plan-check
3 test-fast
3 spazi
3 comandi-equivalenza
3 gates
3 tools/suite.test.sh
3 maat-paths
3 maat-config
3 ciclo-worktree
3 context-pack
3 cycle-report
3 harness-merge
3 stop-hook
3 blocks-independent
3 test-review-surface
3 bash-node
3 genericita
3 maat-doctor
3 senza-wsl
3 session-start
3 phase-usage
3 vitest-classify
